[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4005992037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117016#issuecomment-4005992037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117016","id":4005992037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uxpZl","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T15:44:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T16:19:03Z","body":"@kitbdev, I apologize for the late reply, and great catch with those bypass routes, thank you for testing that!\r\n\r\nYou were completely right. I ran it through GDB and traced the call stack. When bypassing the SceneTreeDock shield (like via the Script Workspace), the dialog's config() loop calls _language_changed(), which was pulling a nullptr from ScriptServer and immediately trying to dereference it before the UI could even finish initializing.\r\n\r\nI've updated the PR to include a hard nullptr shield inside _language_changed() & _update_template_menu() to prevent the segfault, alongside explicitly disabling the get_ok_button() so the downstream creation logic can never be triggered in a 0-language state. Tested locally and the crash is completely resolved! If there's any more adjustments that need to be made, kindly let me know!\r\n\r\nVisual Update for reference as to how it looks now: \r\n<img width=\"597\" height=\"470\" alt=\"image_2026-03-05_212951942\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c04cf473-1765-4a3e-af93-a326398186d2\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4005992037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011797776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117016#issuecomment-4011797776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117016","id":4011797776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vHy0Q","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T13:35:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T13:35:39Z","body":"@kitbdev Thanks for catching that, and I really appreciate you taking the time to review this! I honestly wasn't aware that auto-translation was disabled for this specific menu, so that's a great catch. I've pushed the suggested changes to the file. Let me know if there's anything else I missed. Thank you!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4011797776/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4026660003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117016#issuecomment-4026660003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117016","id":4026660003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7wAfSj","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T20:21:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T20:21:02Z","body":"Thanks!"